00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.919
Say I want to get all the FASTA proteins for
soybean.

00:08:35.919 --> 00:08:43.890
I could use blastcmd to do that, this time
directly with that taxid, which is very useful.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.670
